-- Seed 12 sample products across 7 categories with inventory
-- All prices in kobo (bigint). 1500000 kobo = 15,000 Naira.
-- perk_style only allows 'gold' or 'neutral'.
-- image_badge_style allows 'navy','emerald','gold','bronze','red'.
-- search_vector is auto-generated, not inserted manually.

