     'This rechargeable LED emergency bulb works as a normal light bulb but switches to battery power automatically when electricity cuts off. The built-in battery provides up to 4 hours of light after a full charge. Just screw it into any standard E27 socket. Perfect for Nigerian homes and businesses that experience frequent power outages. Energy-efficient 12W LED.',
