     true, 7, 'Essential', 'Rechargeable LED Emergency Bulb Nigeria | MUBAZZAR', 'Buy rechargeable LED emergency bulb in Nigeria. 4-hour backup, E27 socket, auto-switch. Pay on delivery.', 4.6, 1, 203),
