    ('wireless-door-window-alarm', 'Wireless Door Window Alarm Sensor',
     'Instant alerts when doors or windows open. Easy stick-on install, loud 120dB siren.',
     'Secure your home or shop with this wireless door and window alarm. The magnetic sensor triggers a 120dB siren the moment a door or window is opened. No wiring needed \u2014 just peel and stick the sensor to any door or window frame. Armed/disarmed with a remote control (included). Perfect for Nigerian homes, shops, and apartments that need affordable security.',
